---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
import Choice from '../../../components/Choice.astro';
// DRAFT
---
<Tunnel title="Clean Rebuild | Save My Gig" status="Full_Recovery">
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT, review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Step 3</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Rebuild it the right way</h2>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Rekordbox in <span class="mono">EXPORT</span> mode, drive connected.</li>
    <li><strong>Re-export your playlists fresh.</strong> Never copy an old database back onto a clean drive.</li>
    <!-- "File > Library maintenance" does not exist in the rekordbox 7 manual;
         the verified path (rekordbox 7.2.3 manual) is File > Library > Backup
         Library. A wrong menu path on a rebuild screen is a DJ hunting a menu
         that is not there, so the unverified step is gone. -->
    <li>Then: File → Library → <strong>Backup Library</strong>, to a different drive or cloud.</li>
    <li>Update Rekordbox and player firmware while you're here.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Export + maintenance + backup all done?</p>

  <Choice step="fr_rebuild"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/full-recovery/verify', label: 'YES, ALL DONE' }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/full-recovery/verify', label: 'EXPORT DONE, SKIPPED REST', desc: 'OK for today. The backup habit is what keeps you off this site.' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
